<ul>
<li><b>Clear a frame's marks</b> — Notes ▸ Clear Marks on This Frame (⇧⌘⌫), or the trash button on that frame's row in the notes sidebar. ⌘Z undoes it.</li>
<li>Saved sessions open again, and double-click opens them in Asobi.</li>
</ul>
