body { font-family: -apple-system, 'Helvetica Neue', sans-serif; font-size: 13px; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 12px; }
h2 { font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 8px; } ul { margin: 4px 0 10px; padding-left: 20px; } li { margin-bottom: 3px; }
</style>
<h2>Asobi 0.2 (build 180)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Saved sessions open again.</b> Session files were greyed out in the Open dialog. They're now selectable, and double-clicking one in Finder opens it in Asobi.</li>
<li>Shot names never crop in the PDF report; tidier movie-export dialog.</li>
<li>Voice notes can ask for microphone permission (build 175 fix).</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
